Well we know that rand() % num gives us a number from 0 to (num - 1). So after a few revisions and tests in my head, here's my final answer:
(rand() % (max - (min - 1))) + min

If min = 50 & max = 100 then:

(rand() % (100 - (50 - 1))) + 50
=(rand() % (100 - 49)) + 50
=(rand() % 51) + 50
=(0...50) + 50
=(50...100)
